repository-code: "https://github.com/xaviercallens/SocrateAI-Scientific-QuantumFluids"
abstract: >-
  An open Lean 4 / Mathlib library of 181 machine-checked theorems on the structure of quantum
  fluids: correctness of phase-winding vortex detection with its exact failure case, quantized
  circulation, the Galerkin-truncated Gross-Pitaevskii nonlinearity on an arbitrary mode set, the
  Madelung decomposition, and a bridge into the vocabulary of OpenAI's Navier-Stokes formalization.
  No novelty is claimed for any physical statement; two results once regarded as findings were
  withdrawn after a literature check, and RETRACTIONS.md records them in full.
keywords: [Lean 4, Mathlib, formal verification, quantum fluids, superfluidity, Gross-Pitaevskii, quantized vortices]
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Formalizing quantum-fluid structure in Lean 4: a machine-checked library, what the formalization caught, and what it could not"
